Material changes include:

- support for the tested six-key/one-encoder SinLoon board revision;
- corrected GPIO and RGB-chain mapping;
- separate keyboard and vendor Raw HID interfaces;
- Raw HID protocol v2, live bindings, status, and release-all;
- held-key press/release behavior and USB-reset safety;
- per-key RGB effects;
- macOS-native preflight and flashing tools;
- reproducible SDCC build, tests, and public documentation; and
- Agent Micro naming and USB identity management.

The bundled CH554 register header and MIT-licensed tools are identified
separately in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

